          "content": "When folded, this is $\\frac { 1 } { 8 }$ of the circle, or $\\frac { 1 } { 8 }$ of a turn, or $\\frac { 1 } { 8 }$ of $3 6 0 \\%$ or $\\frac { 1 } { 4 }$ of $1 8 0 ^ { \\circ }$ or $\\frac { 1 } { 2 }$ of ${ \\dot { 9 } } 0 ^ { \\circ } =$"
